 Personal Expense Tracker – Python Project
A clean, beginner-friendly Python project demonstrating CRUD operations, data structures, live updates, and category-wise analytics.  
Designed to run smoothly in **VS Code Jupyter Notebook** and built to showcase Python fundamentals to recruiters.

---

## 🚀 Features

### ✔ Create  
Add new expenses with *date, category, amount,* and *description*.

### ✔ Retrieve  
View all recorded expenses neatly formatted.

### ✔ Update  
Modify any field of any selected expense.

### ✔ Delete  
Remove an expense by index.

### ✔ Category Summary  
Automatically computes category-wise totals using Python dictionaries.

---

## 🛠 Tech Used
- **Python 3**
- **Jupyter Notebook (VS Code)**
- Lists, Sets, Dictionaries
- CRUD Functions
- Clean modular architecture

